1
00:00:00,492 --> 00:00:04,162
(Sheldon:)You stayed in Michigan all week
to avoid being around me?

2
00:00:04,162 --> 00:00:05,992
(Amy:)No, no, not just that.

3
00:00:05,998 --> 00:00:07,298
(Penny:)I mean...

4
00:00:07,299 --> 00:00:10,199
(Amy:)Detroit is beautiful
when it's sleeting.

5
00:00:11,036 --> 00:00:12,906
(Sheldon:)You know, I'm not the only one

6
00:00:12,904 --> 00:00:14,434
(Sheldon:)who's unpleasant
when they're sick.

7
00:00:14,439 --> 00:00:17,139
(Sheldon:)When Penny got food poisoning,
she threw up so loudly

8
00:00:17,142 --> 00:00:19,872
(Sheldon:)I could barely hear
the television.

9
00:00:20,746 --> 00:00:22,276
(Amy:)Ooh, I just heard something.

10
00:00:22,281 --> 00:00:23,651
(Amy:)Might be hail, might be gunfire.

11
00:00:23,649 --> 00:00:26,419
(Amy:)Either way, I'm gonna go
take pictures. Bye.

12
00:00:28,587 --> 00:00:29,917
(Raj:)Hey, Stuart.

13
00:00:29,921 --> 00:00:31,851
(Stuart:)Hey. Where's Sheldon?

14
00:00:31,857 --> 00:00:32,957
(Stuart:)Still sick?
LEONARD: No, he's fine.

15
00:00:32,958 --> 00:00:35,428
(Leonard:)We just needed
a little break.

16
00:00:35,427 --> 00:00:36,557
(Stuart:)Yeah, I get that.

17
00:00:36,561 --> 00:00:38,431
(Stuart:)When I brought him his comics
the other day,

18
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:41,530
he said, “Oh, great,
Death is literally at my door.”

19
00:00:42,834 --> 00:00:44,664
(Howard:)He was being a jerk
to everyone.

20
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:45,900
(Howard:)Don't take it personally.

21
00:00:45,904 --> 00:00:48,004
(Stuart:)Oh, I'm on so many
antidepressants,

22
00:00:48,006 --> 00:00:50,276
(Stuart:)I couldn't if I wanted to.

23
00:00:51,576 --> 00:00:54,746
(Raj:)I wish we could do more stuff
without Sheldon.

24
00:00:54,746 --> 00:00:57,376
(Leonard:)I wish that all the time.

25
00:00:57,382 --> 00:01:01,752
(Leonard:)Usually before I blow
out birthday candles.

